---
title: Label upload
description: Send Rapid Parcels the labels your own system prints.
---

When you print your own label for a Rapid Parcels parcel, upload it so customer service can see it. The request is a **multipart form**: the tracking number, your own reference, and the file (PDF or PNG, at most 2 MB).

{% api-operation spec="carriers" path="/labels" method="post" /%}

{% callout type="caution" title="One label per parcel" %}
Uploading again for the same tracking number replaces the earlier label.
{% /callout %}
